sequenceDiagram
  title Analysis sequence diagram - UC-03 Practice with a Generated Quiz (main scenario)
  actor S as Student
  participant QM as QuizMaster
  participant PF as PassageFinder
  participant LR as Local LLM runtime (external)
  participant Z as Quiz
  participant O as Option
  participant R as QuizResult
  S->>+QM: 5 chooses multiple choice and a number of questions
  QM->>QM: 6a checks the number is between 1 and 20
  QM->>+PF: 6b asks for passages from the chosen materials
  PF-->>-QM: passages
  QM->>+LR: 6c asks for that many questions, each with four options and one correct, from the passages
  LR-->>-QM: generated questions
  QM->>QM: 6d checks each question has exactly one correct option and a source passage
  QM->>Z: 6e records the questions with their options and citations
  QM->>S: 6f shows the questions with their options
  S->>QM: 7 chooses an option for a question
  QM->>O: 8 records the option as chosen
  S->>QM: 9 submits the quiz
  QM->>+Z: 10a asks how many chosen options are correct
  Z-->>-QM: number correct
  QM->>R: 10b records the number correct and the total
  QM->>-S: 10c shows the score and each correct option with its source
